---
Print the shell integration script

Usage: work activate [SHELL]

Arguments:
  [SHELL]
          Shell (default: detected from $SHELL)

          Possible values:
          - bash: GNU bash
          - zsh:  zsh
          - fish: fish

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
